      "text": "WHEREAS, the Charter empowers the Mayor at any time,\nby executive order, to create or abolish bureaus, divisions or\npositions within his executive office as he may deem necessary\nto fulfill his duties and from time to time, by executive order,\nto delegate to or withdraw from any member of said office,\nspecified functions, powers and duties, except his power to act\non local laws or resolutions of the Council, to act as a mag-\nistrate or to appoint or remove officials;",
