    {
      "bbox": [
        269,
        2051,
        1950,
        2607
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. Human Resources Administration. There is created in the executive office of the Mayor a Human Resources Administration. The Administration shall be headed by an Administrator who together with three Deputy Administrators and two Commissioners, in addition to the Commissioner of Welfare, the Executive Director of the New York City Youth Board, and the Executive Director of the New York City Commission for the Foster Care of Children, shall be appointed by and serve at the pleasure of the Mayor. The agencies specified in Section 2 (d) of this order and JOIN are directed to make available to the Administrator such assistance as he may request.",
